The instructions are based on building bazel on top of rouge_km tarball, PVR_DDK_Android_MAIN@6728103_source_tree_km.tgz.

- Prepare for the workspace 
Downlaod kleaf // see https://source.android.com/docs/setup/build/building-kernels

$ cd android-kernel 
$ mkdir powervr
$ cd powervr
$ tar -xvf PVR_DDK_Android_MAIN@6728103_source_tree_km.tgz
$ cd rogue_km

apply patch or extract overlay tarball
$ patch -Np1 -i //path/to/patch.diff
or
$ tar -xvf //path/to/bazel.rogue_km.overlay.tar.gz

It shows as:
	config_kernel.h
	config_kernel.mk
	.bazelrc
	./kernel/drivers/staging/imgtec/tc/BUILD.bazel
	./kernel/drivers/staging/imgtec/BUILD.bazel
	./services/server/devices/rogue/BUILD.bazel
	./services/server/devices/volcanic/BUILD.bazel
	./services/system/rogue/BUILD.bazel
	./services/system/volcanic/BUILD.bazel
	./services/include/rogue/BUILD.bazel
	./services/include/volcanic/BUILD.bazel
	./BUILD.bazel
	./hwdefs/rogue/BUILD.bazel
	./hwdefs/volcanic/BUILD.bazel
	./include/rogue/BUILD.bazel
	./include/volcanic/BUILD.bazel
	./include/BUILD.bazel
	./generated/rogue/BUILD.bazel
	./generated/volcanic/BUILD.bazel
	pvr_config_setting.bzl
	README

- Prepare intermediate configuration files: config_kernel.h and config_kernel.mk
The bazel.rogue_km.overlay.tar.gz  prepares config_kernel.h, config_kernel.mk,
and .bazerc of Testchip platform for reference. Users need to customize the
configuration files. In makefile build, do:
$ make config
$ cp //path/to/config_kernel.h //path/to/config_kernel.mk //path/to/android-kernel/powervr/rogue_km/

- Check consistence of .bazelrc and config_kernel.mk
This is under development. Not all configurations have corresponding define in 
bazel build. Only modify configs that have exsited in .bazelrc. The value of
configs should be the same in .bazelrc and config_kernel.mk.

- Generate pvrsrvkm.ko
bazel --bazelrc=.bazelrc build --config=pc_android --verbose_failures --sandbox_debug //powervr/rogue_km:pvrsrvkm
- Generate .ko for platforms in example of testchip
bazel --bazelrc=.bazelrc build --config=pc_android --verbose_failures --sandbox_debug //powervr/rogue_km/kernel/drivers/staging/imgtec/tc:tc
bazel --bazelrc=.bazelrc build --config=pc_android --verbose_failures --sandbox_debug //powervr/rogue_km/kernel/drivers/staging/imgtec/tc:drm_pdp

- Design
The bazel build needs to depend on the intermediate configuration files,
config_kernel.h and config_kernel.mk. In bazel build, it would include
config_kernel.h and translate configurations from config_kernel.mk to
config_setting in bazel. It uses the same logic of what files should be compiled
based on combinations of configurations.
